{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":34,"alongside":35,"kin":36,"engines":61,"usedOn":62,"sites":63,"crewed":64,"museums":65,"hero":66},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/ariane-6.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"specs":28,"tagline":31,"dispatch":32,"description":33},"ariane-6","Ariane 6","launcher","ESA","Multi (Europe)","ArianeGroup","2024-07-09","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","Ariane 5の後継機","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Ariane 6 — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ariane_6","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Ariane 6 — ESA","https://www.esa.int/Enabling_Support/Space_Transportation/Launch_vehicles/Ariane_6","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Ariane 6 maiden flight VA262 (ESA)","https://www.esa.int/Enabling_Support/Space_Transportation/Ariane/Europe_s_new_Ariane_6_rocket_powers_into_space","deep",{"height_m":29,"diameter_m":30},63,5.4,"Ariane 5の成功者","Ariane 6は、もはや自分たちが支配していない市場への欧州の答えである。20年間、Arianeは商業打ち上げを握っていたが、やがて再使用ロケットが価格で下回り、その支配に終止符を打った。2024年から飛ぶAriane 6は、破壊的な新勢力に対する既存勢力の応答であり——Ariane 5より安価で柔軟性が高く、打ち上げの経済が周囲で書き換えられる中、欧州が宇宙へ独自にアクセスする力を保つために作られた。使い捨てロケットが再使用型のライバルを相手に踏みとどまれるかどうかが、いま背負っている未解決の問いである。","Ariane 6は、ArianeGroupが欧州で製造した軌道打ち上げロケットです。Ariane 5の後継機で、2024年から運用されています。",[],[],[37,41,45,49,53,57],{"id":38,"name":39,"tagline":40},"ariane-5","Ariane 5","Rosetta、JWST、Galileo衛星測位システム（ESA）を打ち上げ",{"id":42,"name":43,"tagline":44},"h3","H3","低コストでH-IIA/H-IIBを交換",{"id":46,"name":47,"tagline":48},"vulcan","Vulcan Centaur","Atlas V + Delta IVの後継機；NSSL Phase 3の認証対象 + Dream Chaser向けに計画",{"id":50,"name":51,"tagline":52},"new-glenn","New Glenn","Blue Origin の二段式再利用可能大型軌道打ち上げ機",{"id":54,"name":55,"tagline":56},"starship","Starship","完全に再利用可能な超大型ロケット",{"id":58,"name":59,"tagline":60},"sls-block-1","SLS Block 1","Artemis月探査計画を支える大型ロケット",[],[],[],[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/ariane-6/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
